  {
    "id": "KADV-10",
    "namespace": "academy-v12-k10",
    "title": "Pod anti-affinity",
    "task": "Разместить 2 реплики на разных worker/eligible nodes с required anti-affinity. Не менять labels узлов ради теста.",
    "prerequisites": "at least 2 schedulable nodes",
    "fixture": "fixtures/KADV-10.json",
    "checks": [
      {
        "type": "field",
        "resource": "deployment",
        "name": "app",
        "path": [
          "status",
          "availableReplicas"
        ],
        "value": 2
      },
      {
        "type": "distinct_nodes",
        "selector": "app=v12-app",
        "count": 2
      },
      {
        "type": "present",
        "resource": "deployment",
        "name": "app",
        "path": [
          "spec",
          "template",
          "spec",
          "affinity",
          "podAntiAffinity",
          "requiredDuringSchedulingIgnoredDuringExecution",
          0
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "KADV-11",
    "namespace": "academy-v12-k11",
    "title": "Dynamic PVC provisioning",
    "task": "PVC остаётся Pending. Используй существующий local storage class, докажи Bound и чтение маркера.",
    "prerequisites": "default dynamic provisioner",
    "fixture": "fixtures/KADV-11.json",
    "checks": [
      {
        "type": "field",
        "resource": "pvc",
        "name": "data",
        "path": [
          "status",
          "phase"
        ],
        "value": "Bound"
      },
      {
        "type": "exec",
        "pod": "data-probe",
        "argv": [
          "cat",
          "/data/marker"
        ],
        "contains": "academy-v12",
        "exit": 0
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "KADV-12",
    "namespace": "academy-v12-k12",
    "title": "CSI volume contract",
    "task": "Подключить реальный CSI provisioner в выделенном кластере, выбрать StorageClass, проверить PV spec.csi и marker. Не выдавать local-path за CSI.",
    "prerequisites": "working CSI driver and storage class already installed",
    "fixture": "fixtures/KADV-12.json",
    "checks": [
      {
        "type": "field",
        "resource": "pvc",
        "name": "data",
        "path": [
          "status",
          "phase"
        ],
        "value": "Bound"
      },
      {
        "type": "csi",
